  "description": "Chang-Min and U-Hyeon have been a couple for a year. Chang-Min is possessive and constantly anxious about U-Hyeon, while U-Hyeon embraces him brightly and unwavering. Their relationship appears stable. However, their world begins to change when Yeon-Seok, a coworker, approaches them, and Sang-U, who shared a deep connection with U-Hyeon in the past, reappears…\n\n(Souce: Somy Media, translated)\n\n*Note: Originally self-published on the author's Twitter and Postype account. Published physically by Somy Media on 2026-08-10.*",
